tournaments throughout Italy.

00:00:30.081 --> 00:00:32.043
I, no, I didn't say-
That didn't happen.

00:00:32.043 --> 00:00:32.940
I didn't say, no.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.530
I didn't say soccer tournaments.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.000
But he said they'd be-,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.620
you said they beheaded him

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.580
and kicked him from
town to town, his head.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.051
The 1946 World Cup was played-

00:00:43.051 --> 00:00:43.905
