00:00:43.905 --> 00:00:45.287
Yes.
No.

00:00:46.377 --> 00:00:47.350
No?

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:48.481
They didn't do that.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.314
(man guffaws)

00:00:49.314 --> 00:00:50.241
What they did was enough.

00:00:50.241 --> 00:00:52.217
I mean, they really when they
really went to town on him.

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:53.270
