00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:58.924
(woman laughs)

00:00:58.924 --> 00:01:00.870
You know, I knew Flanagan
for about 17 years

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.790
before I knew his name was Mark.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:03.810
It's not, I looked it up.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:04.907
It's Gertrude.

00:01:04.907 --> 00:01:05.740
