00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:06.614
(man laughs)

00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:10.640
He's Gertrude Peter Paul Flanagan.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.657
I looked it up.

00:01:11.657 --> 00:01:12.490
(Sarah laughs)

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:14.475
I feel self-conscious
about calling him, Mark.

00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:15.308
[Flanagan] Yeah.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.141
I don't want to.

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:16.974
It's Flanny.

00:01:16.974 --> 00:01:17.807
No, don't call him Mark,

00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:18.780
but you should know his name is Mark.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.870
Ah, puts me in mind of a story.

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.486
I'm scolding him, you know?

00:01:22.486 --> 00:01:24.459
You know, it's usually
when I'm scolding him.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.292
Mark!
Yeah?

00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:26.125
Don't touch that.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:29.000
And Beck and I were
riding camels together.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.747
What?
(Sarah laughs)

00:01:31.747 --> 00:01:33.550
He wanted me to be in his new puppet show.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:34.730
