00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.420
And then you find out later, it's true.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.253
Yup.

00:01:37.253 --> 00:01:38.210
Yeah it, that's true.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.330
A lot of it, it's true.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.330
He's like Zellig.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.510
I know. When the Neil
Young thing showed up,

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.797
he was like, "Oh, Neil
wants me to be in his play

00:01:44.797 --> 00:01:46.507
"to play the sea captain.

00:01:46.507 --> 00:01:48.430
"But I can't be playing the sea captain!"

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.771
I'm like, Neil Young has a play,

00:01:49.771 --> 00:01:51.317
and there's a sea captain in it,

00:01:51.317 --> 00:01:52.680
and he wants you to be it?

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:53.913
That's fantastic!

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.046
He wrote "Harvest" on this rug.

00:01:57.046 --> 00:02:00.050
(Conan laughs)

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.600
But the reason Bono
drives a Ford Focus is,

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.500
when people see him,

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.980
