00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:04.890
[Conan] Right.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.888
And they do.

00:02:05.888 --> 00:02:06.721
Are you saying "Right,"

00:02:06.721 --> 00:02:07.554
but you didn't hear what he said?

00:02:07.554 --> 00:02:08.387
I did.

00:02:08.387 --> 00:02:09.220
He said, "Fa-fa-fa-fa-fa-fa Bono."

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:10.053
He said-

00:02:10.053 --> 00:02:10.886
No, I know.

00:02:10.886 --> 00:02:12.330
Nobody thinks Bono is
driving a Ford Focus.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.163
Yeah, no, that was story,

00:02:13.163 --> 00:02:14.998
