00:02:14.998 --> 00:02:18.529
and he had a rental of a Ford Focus,

00:02:18.529 --> 00:02:21.090
and he said, "A Ford Focus?"

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:23.557
And Bono goes, "Yeah, no one's gonna think

00:02:23.557 --> 00:02:25.007
that Bono's in a Ford Focus,

00:02:25.007 --> 00:02:26.007
so I just drive around

00:02:26.007 --> 00:02:27.830
and people go, 'Look at that asshole-'"

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.070
That's why I drive a-
Trying to look like Bono.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.790
Bentley, 'cause no one thinks

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.950
Conan O'Brien's got the money

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.090
