00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.350
I do the same thing the other way.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.950
One morning when I was
coming into Warner brothers

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:39.763
and I saw it come.

00:02:39.763 --> 00:02:43.017
I saw it before, as I was
turning in like a late seventies

00:02:43.017 --> 00:02:45.420
Ford Crown Victoria,

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.510
